Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:04.90,TL,,0,0,0,,上海大师赛第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:07.68,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:09.95,TL,,0,0,0,,逆转{\fs78}11{\fs68}号种子弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:15.06,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘 弗里茨在三平后打出关键破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:17.08,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}先下一城
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.77,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 西西帕斯越打越顺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:22.79,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}扳回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.66,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘他一路领先到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:28.88,TL,,0,0,0,,弗里茨被逼到了悬崖边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:33.25,TL,,0,0,0,,可真正让全场炸锅的 是最后一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:35.65,TL,,0,0,0,,两次从口袋里掉出来的球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:40.16,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 弗里茨发球保级
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}30{\fs68}平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:45.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, interestingly, when did that ball come out of his pocket?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N咦 球什么时候从他口袋掉出来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:47.86,TL,,0,0,0,,主裁当时喊了 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:49.52,TL,,0,0,0,,可关键是 这一声
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:52.43,TL,,0,0,0,,是在弗里茨击球之前 还是之后？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:54.35,TL,,0,0,0,,主裁申请视频回看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:57.00,TL,,0,0,0,,回放里 掉球之后弗里茨照样挥拍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.91,TL,,0,0,0,,这一拍打出了底线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:05.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ladies and gentlemen, after video review,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N女士们先生们 经视频回看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.72,0:01:07.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}my call came after he hit the ball.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我的叫停 在他击球之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:10.25,TL,,0,0,0,,叫停晚了一步 分早已打完
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:12.42,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯 赛点！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:15.43,TL,,0,0,0,,赛点上 同样的事又来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.17,0:01:16.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, hang on.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哎 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:23.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But that's twice. It's his point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可这是第二次了 这分该判给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.34,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 规则书里写着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:28.36,TL,,0,0,0,,口袋掉球算无意妨碍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:29.40,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次被叫停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:31.04,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}let{\fs68} 重新打 并给警告
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:34.18,TL,,0,0,0,,下次再因此被叫停 直接判失分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.01,0:01:37.25,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯觉得这是第二次了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.25,0:01:40.33,TL,,0,0,0,,可规则数的是被叫停 重新打的次数
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:41.44,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}30{\fs68}平那一球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:43.27,TL,,0,0,0,,分已经打完 没有重新打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:44.60,TL,,0,0,0,,所以赛点这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:46.30,TL,,0,0,0,,才是第一次 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.97,0:01:48.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, but the first one, he already lost the point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但第一次 他已经输了那一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.27,0:01:49.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was not replayed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没有重新打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.91,0:01:51.30,TL,,0,0,0,,弗里茨救下赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.24,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯这一局错失{\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:58.21,TL,,0,0,0,,下一局他发球胜赛 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}晋级
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.16,TL,,0,0,0,,一个口袋里的球 两次判罚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.16,0:02:03.20,TL,,0,0,0,,规则其实写得清清楚楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:04.64,TL,,0,0,0,,下次再看到掉球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:06.68,TL,,0,0,0,,你也能当一回主裁吗？
